@RequestBody@RequestBody 用于接收请求体中的数据，常见的有两种用法：

接收原始字符串（请求体是什么就拿到什么）
接收 JSON 数据并转为 Java 对象（实际开发中最常用）

// 用法一：接收原始字符串@ResponseBody@PostMapping(&quot;/requestBody&quot;)public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; requestBody(@RequestBody String allParams) &#123;    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; result = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();    result.put(&quot;allParams&quot;, allParams);    // Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded    // 请求体：username=admin&amp;hobbies=java&amp;hobbies=c    // &#123;    //   &quot;allParams&quot;: &quot;username=admin&amp;hobbies=java&amp;hobbies=c&quot;    // &#125;    return result;&#125;

// 用法二：接收 JSON 并转为 Java 对象// 请求体：&#123;&quot;username&quot;:&quot;admin&quot;,&quot;age&quot;:18&#125;@ResponseBody@PostMapping(&quot;/requestBodyJson&quot;)public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; requestBodyJson(@RequestBody User user) &#123;    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; result = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();    result.put(&quot;user&quot;, user);    // &#123;    //   &quot;user&quot;: &#123;    //     &quot;username&quot;: &quot;admin&quot;,    //     &quot;age&quot;: 18    //   &#125;    // &#125;    return result;&#125;

原理简述：@RequestBody 由 RequestResponseBodyMethodProcessor 解析，底层通过 HttpMessageConverter（消息转换器）将请求体转换为目标对象。JSON 的转换由 Jackson 提供的 MappingJackson2HttpMessageConverter 完成。在 Spring Boot 中，只要引入了 spring-boot-starter-web，就已经内置了 Jackson，无需额外配置。
// 核心转换逻辑@Overridepublic Object resolveArgument(MethodParameter parameter, ModelAndViewContainer mavContainer,        NativeWebRequest webRequest, WebDataBinderFactory binderFactory) throws Exception &#123;    // 根据参数类型找到支持的 HttpMessageConverter，例如 JSON -&gt; MappingJackson2HttpMessageConverter    HttpMessageConverter&lt;?&gt; converter = getMessageConverter(parameter, request);    // 读取请求体并转换为目标类型    Object arg = readWithMessageConverters(webRequest, parameter, parameter.getNestedGenericParameterType());    // ......&#125;


@RequestBody 与 @RequestParam 的区别：@RequestParam 从 URL 查询参数或表单字段中取值，@RequestBody 从请求体中取值（JSON、XML 等）

@RequestAttribute@GetMapping(&quot;/requestAttribute&quot;)public String requestAttribute(Model model) &#123;    model.addAttribute(&quot;username&quot;, &quot;admin&quot;);    return &quot;forward:/success&quot;;&#125;@ResponseBody@GetMapping(&quot;/success&quot;)public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; success(@RequestAttribute(&quot;username&quot;) String username,                                    HttpServletRequest request) &#123;    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; result = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();    result.put(&quot;username&quot;, username);    result.put(&quot;request&quot;, request.getAttribute(&quot;username&quot;));    // &#123;    //   &quot;request&quot;: &quot;admin&quot;,    //   &quot;username&quot;: &quot;admin&quot;    // &#125;    return result;&#125;

@ModelAttribute@ModelAttribute 有两种用法：

方法级：标注在 @Controller 的方法上，任意 handler 方法执行前会先执行该方法，并把返回值放入 Model
参数级：标注在形参上，将请求参数绑定到该对象上（也可以省略不写，Spring 默认就会自动绑定）

// 方法级：请求到达前，先把 user 放入 Model@ModelAttribute(&quot;user&quot;)public User initUser() &#123;    User user = new User();    user.setUsername(&quot;admin&quot;);    return user;&#125;@ResponseBody@GetMapping(&quot;/modelAttribute&quot;)public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; modelAttribute(@ModelAttribute(&quot;user&quot;) User user) &#123;    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; result = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();    result.put(&quot;user&quot;, user);    // 请求 /modelAttribute?username=zhangsan&amp;age=18 时：    // 1. 先执行 initUser()，Model 中有了 user（username=admin）    // 2. 再将请求参数绑定到该对象上（username 被覆盖为 zhangsan）    // &#123;    //   &quot;user&quot;: &#123;    //     &quot;username&quot;: &quot;zhangsan&quot;,    //     &quot;age&quot;: 18    //   &#125;    // &#125;    return result;&#125;


注意：方法级 @ModelAttribute 只对当前 Controller 生效，且每次请求都会先执行，若其他 handler 方法也使用同名的 Model 属性，可能会被影响，需留意

@MatrixVariable@MatrixVariable 是 Spring MVC 中的一个注解，用于从 URL 路径中的矩阵变量（Matrix Variables） 里提取值。
矩阵变量是 URI 规范（RFC 3986）中的一种扩展语法，以 分号 ; 分隔，附加在路径段（path segment）上，如：/colors/red;r=255;g=0;b=0
Spring Boot 默认不会解析矩阵变量，需要通过配置开启：覆写 configurePathMatch，设置 setRemoveSemicolonContent(false)（false 表示不移除路径中的分号内容）。
public class UrlPathHelper &#123;    // ......    // 会移除路径中的分号    private boolean removeSemicolonContent = true;    // ......&#125;

setUrlPathHelper() 在 Spring Framework 7.0 中已被标记为弃用并移除。以下是更新后的配置方式：
// ========== 旧版（Spring 5.x / 6.x）—— 已废弃 ==========@Configurationpublic class WebConfig implements WebMvcConfigurer &#123;    @Override    public void configurePathMatch(PathMatchConfigurer configurer) &#123;        UrlPathHelper urlPathHelper = new UrlPathHelper();        urlPathHelper.setRemoveSemicolonContent(false);  // ← 要保留分号内容        configurer.setUrlPathHelper(urlPathHelper);       // ← 7.0 已移除    &#125;&#125;// ========== 新版（Spring 7.0+） ==========@Configurationpublic class WebConfig implements WebMvcConfigurer &#123;    @Override    public void configurePathMatch(PathMatchConfigurer configurer) &#123;        PathPatternParser parser = new PathPatternParser();        configurer.setPatternParser(parser);  // ← PathPatternParser 自带矩阵变量支持    &#125;&#125;

@ResponseBody// URL: /cars/shell;color=red;brand=Mercedes-Benz,BMW,Audi@GetMapping(&quot;/cars/&#123;path&#125;&quot;)public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; getCars(@MatrixVariable(&quot;color&quot;) String color,                                    @MatrixVariable(&quot;brand&quot;) List&lt;String&gt; brand,                                    @PathVariable(&quot;path&quot;) String path) &#123;    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; result = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();    result.put(&quot;color&quot;, color);    result.put(&quot;brand&quot;, brand);    result.put(&quot;path&quot;, path);    // &#123;    //   &quot;path&quot;: &quot;shell&quot;,    //   &quot;color&quot;: &quot;red&quot;,    //   &quot;brand&quot;: [    //     &quot;Mercedes-Benz&quot;,    //     &quot;BMW&quot;,    //     &quot;Audi&quot;    //   ]    // &#125;    return result;&#125;

当不同路径段上存在同名矩阵变量时，需要通过 pathVar 属性指定从哪一段取值：
@ResponseBody// URL: /cars/shell;color=red;brand=Mercedes-Benz,BMW,Audi/buy;color=blue;brand=Lamborghini,Rolls-Royce@GetMapping(&quot;/cars/&#123;path1&#125;/&#123;path2&#125;&quot;)public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; getCars(@MatrixVariable(value = &quot;color&quot;, pathVar = &quot;path1&quot;) String color1,                                    @MatrixVariable(value = &quot;brand&quot;, pathVar = &quot;path1&quot;) List&lt;String&gt; brand1,                                    @PathVariable(&quot;path1&quot;) String path1,                                    @MatrixVariable(value = &quot;color&quot;, pathVar = &quot;path2&quot;) String color2,                                    @MatrixVariable(value = &quot;brand&quot;, pathVar = &quot;path2&quot;) List&lt;String&gt; brand2,                                    @PathVariable(&quot;path2&quot;) String path2) &#123;    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; result = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();    result.put(&quot;color1&quot;, color1);    result.put(&quot;brand1&quot;, brand1);    result.put(&quot;path1&quot;, path1);    result.put(&quot;color2&quot;, color2);    result.put(&quot;brand2&quot;, brand2);    result.put(&quot;path2&quot;, path2);    // &#123;    //   &quot;color1&quot;: &quot;red&quot;,    //   &quot;color2&quot;: &quot;blue&quot;,    //   &quot;path1&quot;: &quot;shell&quot;,    //   &quot;brand2&quot;: [    //     &quot;Lamborghini&quot;,    //     &quot;Rolls-Royce&quot;    //   ],    //   &quot;brand1&quot;: [    //     &quot;Mercedes-Benz&quot;,    //     &quot;BMW&quot;,    //     &quot;Audi&quot;    //   ],    //   &quot;path2&quot;: &quot;buy&quot;    // &#125;    return result;&#125;

自定义对象参数Spring 会自动将请求参数绑定到 POJO 的成员变量上，要求参数名与成员变量名一致，同时支持级联封装（对象.属性 的写法）
// POJO：Address 与 Userpublic class Address &#123;    private String province;    private String city;    // getter、setter、toString ……&#125;public class User &#123;    private String username;    private Integer age;    private Address address;      // 级联封装    // getter、setter、toString ……&#125;

@ResponseBody// 请求：/pojo?username=admin&amp;age=18&amp;address.province=河南&amp;address.city=郑州@GetMapping(&quot;/pojo&quot;)public Map&lt;String, Object&gt; pojo(User user) &#123;    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; result = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();    result.put(&quot;user&quot;, user);    // &#123;    //   &quot;user&quot;: &#123;    //     &quot;username&quot;: &quot;admin&quot;,    //     &quot;age&quot;: 18,    //     &quot;address&quot;: &#123;    //       &quot;province&quot;: &quot;河南&quot;,    //       &quot;city&quot;: &quot;郑州&quot;    //     &#125;    //   &#125;    // &#125;    return result;&#125;


这里 age 是 Integer 类型，Spring 会自动完成 String → Integer 的类型转换，背后是 WebDataBinder + ConversionService 在起作用，原理部分会讲到

请求映射我们可以通过 @RequestMapping 注解来将请求路径映射到对应的方法上
RESTful 风格，本着万物皆是资源的原则，在同一个请求路径中通过不同的请求方式，来访问不同的资源

&#x2F;user(GET、DELETE、PUT、POST)

在 Spring MVC 中我们就讲过，浏览器并不直接支持 DELETE 和 PUT 请求。为此，Spring MVC 提供了 HiddenHttpMethodFilter：通过在 form 表单中添加一个隐藏字段（默认 _method），来实现 GET 和 POST 以外的请求方式。
参考文档
// HiddenHttpMethodFilter.java 核心代码@Overrideprotected void doFilterInternal(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response, FilterChain filterChain)        throws ServletException, IOException &#123;    HttpServletRequest requestToUse = request;    // 前提 form 必须是 POST 请求    if (&quot;POST&quot;.equals(request.getMethod()) &amp;&amp; request.getAttribute(WebUtils.ERROR_EXCEPTION_ATTRIBUTE) == null) &#123;        // 根据指定字段获取参数，默认是 _method        String paramValue = request.getParameter(this.methodParam);        if (StringUtils.hasLength(paramValue)) &#123;            // 转为大写            String method = paramValue.toUpperCase(Locale.ROOT);            // 判断是否是被支持的请求方式（DELETE、PUT、PATCH）            if (ALLOWED_METHODS.contains(method)) &#123;                requestToUse = new HttpMethodRequestWrapper(request, method);            &#125;        &#125;    &#125;    filterChain.doFilter(requestToUse, response);&#125;

&lt;form th:action=&quot;@&#123;/test&#125;&quot; method=&quot;get&quot;&gt;  &lt;input type=&quot;submit&quot; value=&quot;GET&quot; /&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;form th:action=&quot;@&#123;/test&#125;&quot; method=&quot;post&quot;&gt;  &lt;input type=&quot;submit&quot; value=&quot;POST&quot; /&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;form th:action=&quot;@&#123;/test&#125;&quot; method=&quot;post&quot;&gt;  &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;_method&quot; value=&quot;DELETE&quot; /&gt;  &lt;input type=&quot;submit&quot; value=&quot;DELETE&quot; /&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;form th:action=&quot;@&#123;/test&#125;&quot; method=&quot;post&quot;&gt;  &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;_method&quot; value=&quot;PUT&quot; /&gt;  &lt;input type=&quot;submit&quot; value=&quot;PUT&quot; /&gt;&lt;/form&gt;

在 Spring Boot 中，WebMvcAutoConfiguration 自动配置类已经帮我们配置好了这个过滤器，但默认不会生效，需要通过 spring.mvc.hiddenmethod.filter.enabled=true 手动开启。
@Bean@ConditionalOnMissingBean(HiddenHttpMethodFilter.class)// 需要在配置文件中配置 spring.mvc.hiddenmethod.filter.enabled ，否则不满足加载条件@ConditionalOnBooleanProperty(&quot;spring.mvc.hiddenmethod.filter.enabled&quot;)OrderedHiddenHttpMethodFilter hiddenHttpMethodFilter() &#123;    return new OrderedHiddenHttpMethodFilter();&#125;

spring:  mvc:    hiddenmethod:      filter:        enabled: true

在源码中可以看到，过滤器是通过 this.methodParam 来指定隐藏字段的，默认为 _method。如果我们想修改该字段，可以自己提供一个 HiddenHttpMethodFilter 的 Bean，这样 Spring Boot 就不会再加载默认的那个了。
// 默认值public static final String DEFAULT_METHOD_PARAM = &quot;_method&quot;;// 默认为 _methodprivate String methodParam = DEFAULT_METHOD_PARAM;// 我们可以自己提供实例，通过 set 方法来指定字段public void setMethodParam(String methodParam) &#123;    Assert.hasText(methodParam, &quot;&#x27;methodParam&#x27; must not be empty&quot;);    this.methodParam = methodParam;&#125;

@Beanpublic HiddenHttpMethodFilter hiddenHttpMethodFilter() &#123;    HiddenHttpMethodFilter hiddenHttpMethodFilter = new HiddenHttpMethodFilter();    // 重新指定字段    hiddenHttpMethodFilter.setMethodParam(&quot;method&quot;);    return hiddenHttpMethodFilter;&#125;

Spring Boot 的本质还是一个 Servlet 应用，核心则是 DispatcherServlet。通过源码可以发现，DispatcherServlet 继承自 FrameworkServlet，而 FrameworkServlet 最终又继承自 HttpServlet。
我们在学习 Servlet 时，想要实现请求的分发，就必须重写 doGet 和 doPost 方法，查看整个继承链路，可以发现在 FrameworkServlet 中重写了 doXxx 各种方法
/** * Delegate &#123;@code GET&#125; requests to processRequest/doService. * &lt;p&gt;Will also be invoked by HttpServlet&#x27;s default implementation of &#123;@code doHead&#125;, * with a &#123;@code NoBodyResponse&#125; that just captures the content length. * @see #doService * @see #doHead */@Overrideprotected final void doGet(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)        throws ServletException, IOException &#123;    processRequest(request, response);&#125;/** * Delegate &#123;@code POST&#125; requests to &#123;@link #processRequest&#125;. * @see #doService */@Overrideprotected final void doPost(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)        throws ServletException, IOException &#123;    processRequest(request, response);&#125;/** * Delegate &#123;@code PUT&#125; requests to &#123;@link #processRequest&#125;. * @see #doService */@Overrideprotected final void doPut(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)        throws ServletException, IOException &#123;    processRequest(request, response);&#125;/** * Delegate &#123;@code DELETE&#125; requests to &#123;@link #processRequest&#125;. * @see #doService */@Overrideprotected final void doDelete(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)        throws ServletException, IOException &#123;    processRequest(request, response);&#125;

可以看到，所有方法都指向了 processRequest 方法
protected final void processRequest(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)        throws ServletException, IOException &#123;    long startTime = System.currentTimeMillis();    Throwable failureCause = null;    LocaleContext previousLocaleContext = LocaleContextHolder.getLocaleContext();    LocaleContext localeContext = buildLocaleContext(request);    RequestAttributes previousAttributes = RequestContextHolder.getRequestAttributes();    ServletRequestAttributes requestAttributes = buildRequestAttributes(request, response, previousAttributes);    WebAsyncManager asyncManager = WebAsyncUtils.getAsyncManager(request);    asyncManager.registerCallableInterceptor(FrameworkServlet.class.getName(), new RequestBindingInterceptor());    initContextHolders(request, localeContext, requestAttributes);    try &#123;        doService(request, response);    &#125;    catch (ServletException | IOException ex) &#123;        failureCause = ex;        throw ex;    &#125;    catch (Throwable ex) &#123;        failureCause = ex;        throw new ServletException(&quot;Request processing failed: &quot; + ex, ex);    &#125;    finally &#123;        resetContextHolders(request, previousLocaleContext, previousAttributes);        if (requestAttributes != null) &#123;            requestAttributes.requestCompleted();        &#125;        logResult(request, response, failureCause, asyncManager);        publishRequestHandledEvent(request, response, startTime, failureCause);    &#125;&#125;

可以看到 doService 才是真正的执行方法，而 doService 则是在 DispatcherServlet 中实现的
@Overrideprotected void doService(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response) throws Exception &#123;    logRequest(request);    // Keep a snapshot of the request attributes in case of an include,    // to be able to restore the original attributes after the include.    Map&lt;String, Object&gt; attributesSnapshot = null;    if (WebUtils.isIncludeRequest(request)) &#123;        attributesSnapshot = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();        Enumeration&lt;?&gt; attrNames = request.getAttributeNames();        while (attrNames.hasMoreElements()) &#123;            String attrName = (String) attrNames.nextElement();            if (this.cleanupAfterInclude || attrName.startsWith(DEFAULT_STRATEGIES_PREFIX)) &#123;                attributesSnapshot.put(attrName, request.getAttribute(attrName));            &#125;        &#125;    &#125;    // Make framework objects available to handlers and view objects.    request.setAttribute(WEB_APPLICATION_CONTEXT_ATTRIBUTE, getWebApplicationContext());    request.setAttribute(LOCALE_RESOLVER_ATTRIBUTE, this.localeResolver);    if (this.flashMapManager != null) &#123;        FlashMap inputFlashMap = this.flashMapManager.retrieveAndUpdate(request, response);        if (inputFlashMap != null) &#123;            request.setAttribute(INPUT_FLASH_MAP_ATTRIBUTE, Collections.unmodifiableMap(inputFlashMap));        &#125;        request.setAttribute(OUTPUT_FLASH_MAP_ATTRIBUTE, new FlashMap());        request.setAttribute(FLASH_MAP_MANAGER_ATTRIBUTE, this.flashMapManager);    &#125;    RequestPath previousRequestPath = null;    if (this.parseRequestPath) &#123;        previousRequestPath = (RequestPath) request.getAttribute(ServletRequestPathUtils.PATH_ATTRIBUTE);        ServletRequestPathUtils.parseAndCache(request);    &#125;    try &#123;        doDispatch(request, response);    &#125;    finally &#123;        if (!WebAsyncUtils.getAsyncManager(request).isConcurrentHandlingStarted()) &#123;            // Restore the original attribute snapshot, in case of an include.            if (attributesSnapshot != null) &#123;                restoreAttributesAfterInclude(request, attributesSnapshot);            &#125;        &#125;        if (this.parseRequestPath) &#123;            ServletRequestPathUtils.setParsedRequestPath(previousRequestPath, request);        &#125;    &#125;&#125;

doService 又指向了 doDispatch
protected void doDispatch(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response) throws Exception &#123;    HttpServletRequest processedRequest = request;    HandlerExecutionChain mappedHandler = null;    // multi-part 文件上传，默认是 false    boolean multipartRequestParsed = false;    WebAsyncManager asyncManager = WebAsyncUtils.getAsyncManager(request);    try &#123;        ModelAndView mv = null;        Exception dispatchException = null;        try &#123;            // 检查是否是文件上传            processedRequest = checkMultipart(request);            multipartRequestParsed = (processedRequest != request);            // 根据请求获取对应的 handler            mappedHandler = getHandler(processedRequest);            if (mappedHandler == null) &#123;                noHandlerFound(processedRequest, response);                return;            &#125;            if (!mappedHandler.applyPreHandle(processedRequest, response)) &#123;                return;            &#125;            // Determine handler adapter and invoke the handler.            HandlerAdapter ha = getHandlerAdapter(mappedHandler.getHandler());            mv = ha.handle(processedRequest, response, mappedHandler.getHandler());            if (asyncManager.isConcurrentHandlingStarted()) &#123;                return;            &#125;            applyDefaultViewName(processedRequest, mv);            mappedHandler.applyPostHandle(processedRequest, response, mv);        &#125;        catch (Exception ex) &#123;            dispatchException = ex;        &#125;        catch (Throwable err) &#123;            // As of 4.3, we&#x27;re processing Errors thrown from handler methods as well,            // making them available for @ExceptionHandler methods and other scenarios.            dispatchException = new ServletException(&quot;Handler dispatch failed: &quot; + err, err);        &#125;        processDispatchResult(processedRequest, response, mappedHandler, mv, dispatchException);    &#125;    catch (Exception ex) &#123;        triggerAfterCompletion(processedRequest, response, mappedHandler, ex);    &#125;    catch (Throwable err) &#123;        triggerAfterCompletion(processedRequest, response, mappedHandler,                new ServletException(&quot;Handler processing failed: &quot; + err, err));    &#125;    finally &#123;        if (asyncManager.isConcurrentHandlingStarted()) &#123;            // Instead of postHandle and afterCompletion            if (mappedHandler != null) &#123;                mappedHandler.applyAfterConcurrentHandlingStarted(processedRequest, response);            &#125;            asyncManager.setMultipartRequestParsed(multipartRequestParsed);        &#125;        else &#123;            // Clean up any resources used by a multipart request.            if (multipartRequestParsed || asyncManager.isMultipartRequestParsed()) &#123;                cleanupMultipart(processedRequest);            &#125;        &#125;    &#125;&#125;protected @Nullable HandlerExecutionChain getHandler(HttpServletRequest request) throws Exception &#123;    // this.handlerMappings 全部的映射规则，按 order 从小到大依次匹配    // 1. faviconHandlerMapping      站点图标映射（**/favicon.ico）    // 2. RequestMappingHandlerMapping   注解映射（@RequestMapping 等）    // 3. viewControllerHandlerMapping   视图控制器映射（addViewController 注册）    // 4. welcomePageHandlerMapping  欢迎页映射（/ 访问 index.html）    // 5. beanNameHandlerMapping      Bean 名称映射（bean 名以 / 开头）    // 6. routerFunctionMapping      函数式路由映射    // 7. resourceHandlerMapping     静态资源映射（/** 下的 css/js/img）    if (this.handlerMappings != null) &#123;        for (HandlerMapping mapping : this.handlerMappings) &#123;            HandlerExecutionChain handler = mapping.getHandler(request);            if (handler != null) &#123;                return handler;            &#125;        &#125;    &#125;    return null;&#125;

在此基础上，我们便可以通过自定义 HandlerMapping 来添加自己的映射规则

